      "normalizedSource": "`RequiredDNSServers` ([string]): An array of IP addresses of DNS servers to use for resolving the specified domains. These servers don’t need to be part of the device’s current network configuration. If these DNS servers aren’t reachable, the system establishes a VPN connection. These DNS servers need to be either internal DNS servers or trusted external DNS servers. This key is valid only if the value of ‘DomainAction’ is ‘ConnectIfNeeded’.",
